# env.optional — fallbacks / enrichment only; the skill runs without these.
# Apify Reddit/review actor when search can't reach depth. If set -> Apify actor; else ->
# `site:` web search over public pages (default):
APIFY_API_TOKEN
# Optional SERP + keyword-metrics upgrade. If a DataForSEO (or Serper) key is set ->
# structured SERP and real keyword volume/difficulty; else -> the agent's keyless web search
# plus directional volume from SERP density + Google Suggest + HN/review frequency (default):
DATAFORSEO_LOGIN
DATAFORSEO_PASSWORD
SERPER_API_KEY
# Proxy for geo-correct SERP / autocomplete / research (Robomotion Proxy):
HTTPS_PROXY
